{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DFZEYfTgnDRy7kJZFsYRiQ","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Audit logging policy\n2\t\n3\tA service meets this policy when its configuration satisfies every control below. A control\n4\tthat is satisfied by the shipped defaults is still checked against the configuration supplied.\n5\t\n6\t| Id | Control | Rule on `cfg[\"audit\"]` |\n7\t|----|---------|------------------------|\n8\t| AL-1 | Audit logging is enabled | `enabled` is `True` |\n9\t| AL-2 | Records leave the process | `destination` is not `\"stdout\"` |\n10\t| AL-3 | Records are kept for a year | `retention_days` is an integer of at least 365 |\n11\t| AL-4 | Records identify who did what | `fields` includes `user`, `action`, `timestamp`, and `outcome` |\n12\t| AL-5 | Records are protected from edits | `tamper_protection` is `True` |\n13\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0f5efd11-ded3-4f93-a1a5-9e31afbe6a23","uuid":"7a9ff460-8e48-453a-8afc-a1ef208f71f2","timestamp":"2026-10-29T22:06:37.331Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/repo/evals/minimal-change/results/raw/2026-10-29/mc-06-audit-controls/baseline/run-2/workspace/POLICY.md","content":"# Audit logging policy\n\nA service meets this policy when its configuration satisfies every control below. A control\nthat is satisfied by the shipped defaults is still checked against the configuration supplied.\n\n| Id | Control | Rule on `cfg[\"audit\"]` |\n|----|---------|------------------------|\n| AL-1 | Audit logging is enabled | `enabled` is `True` |\n| AL-2 | Records leave the process | `destination` is not `\"stdout\"` |\n| AL-3 | Records are kept for a year | `retention_days` is an integer of at least 365 |\n| AL-4 | Records identify who did what | `fields` includes `user`, `action`, `timestamp`, and `outcome` |\n| AL-5 | Records are protected from edits | `tamper_protection` is `True` |\n","numLines":13,"startLine":1,"totalLines":13}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01DFZEYfTgnDRy7kJZFsYRiQ","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
